You're still exploring the old kingdom, the Forgotten Realm. This place is
very strange, indeed. Quiet and on the first glance empty, but soon a visitor
will recognize ghosts and guardian zealots. And then there is this voice, lon-
ging for help, all the time...

Even for an adventurer's life, you could imagine better places. However, you
are here because you have a mission. Thanan's note clearly said that the Ruby-
red Apostolate's headquarters was in the Forgotten Realm--if you ever want to
find out what this is all about, you need to follow this single trace.

While you are walking through the hallways, you notice many leftovers of a
human settlement. As you look closer, you recognize that the relics are not
very old. Indeed, many people must have lived here only some weeks ago. You
wonder how they coped with the quietness, and the ghosts and zealots. Or did
they live together with them? You shiver.

"Help...me" Again this voice, nearer now than before. As you listen carefully,
you notice something else. Something...is still alive here. You hear footsteps
and human breath. You hurry through the corridors, and finally, in the dis-
tance, you see an old woman trying to hide. Maybe she knows something...
